{"parse": {"title": "7TH-30", "pageid": 55171, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/7TH-29\" title=\"7TH-29\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">7TH-30</span><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-01\" title=\"8TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">7TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">30</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B0.A2.E5.B9.95.E8.AF.8D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"谢幕词\">谢幕词</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 谢幕词</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">And Now, the Curtain Call</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"2/1902\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8B%8B%E7%AB%A0%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93\" title=\"勋章流体\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8B%8B%E7%AB%A0%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93\" title=\"勋章流体\"><img alt=\"勋章流体\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/CurrencyItem-100902.png/100px-CurrencyItem-100902.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/CurrencyItem-100902.png/150px-CurrencyItem-100902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/CurrencyItem-100902.png/200px-CurrencyItem-100902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">500</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抖<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>肩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>水<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>随<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>步<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>了<span class=\"color-value\"></span>新<span class=\"color-value\"></span>世<span class=\"color-value\"></span>界<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10730</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的朋友们正欲扬帆起航。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而年长些的人们正在挥别过去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_luxibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_luxibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，我想这十五个插头已经涵盖了目的地一切可能的电源形制。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>希曼，请把之前的实验记录也递给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拂去桌面上的灰尘，最后一次清点实验室内的设备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间内没有开灯，已经不再有这个必要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门口传来了一阵急促的敲门声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>请——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她没能走完符合人类社会礼仪的流程，因为来人已经急切地推开了门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这是真的吗，露西女士？！您要离开拉普拉斯科算中心——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是的，问询会已经结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这是所有人商议的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>他们在开什么国际玩笑！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜重重地拍了一下桌子，实验遗留的灰尘从上面震了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您做出了如此卓越的贡献，他们——却要停您的职？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>没有比这更荒谬的事了！没有您，我们根本不可能做出平衡伞，光副作用就会杀死每一个人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，实际上还是有不少人因此牺牲。因为我低估了咒文的危害，造成了不可控的传播事故。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你之前不是也为此深切抗议吗，阿德勒·霍夫曼研究员？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>那是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器友好地朝他点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>很意外，你态度转变得如此之快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不过这正是我们需要的精神——理性的自我革新精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>文件被有序归档。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助理希曼走到露西女士旁边，接过了她手里沉重的实验仪器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>扬起的灰尘让哑谜咳嗽了几声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>实际上，这次决策是合理的。他们必须照顾总部来自各阶层种族背景的工作人员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们花了八年，才在雨幕中撑开第一把伞。但即使是这样的速度，对一些人而言也太快了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>人们的情绪需要一个出口，需要有人为这些事故和牺牲负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>已经有许多研究员寄来投诉信，指责我冷酷、无人性、无感情、践踏生命、反人道主义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在基金会、芝诺和这里，也有许多人质疑能否让一个觉醒的蒸汽活塞就任科算中心的负责人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他们对我的神秘学能力是否在可控范围存有不同意见，并怀疑我正因能力失控而逐渐失去理性的决策能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器顿了顿，像是突然想起了一处疏漏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，毕竟我违反保密协定在维也纳传播了扭结。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不过，的确有人因此活下来。——这就够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人类研究员没有关注到这一补充。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他已经出于愤怒地握紧了拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>所以，他们……质疑您的立场？就因为您是意识唤醒者，是神秘学家？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>质疑一台比任何人都信奉科技和进步的机器，不够“理性”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这真是我有生以来听过最可笑的事——在我自己都放弃的时候，是您提出来必须考虑人类！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——我疑惑的是，你为什么这么激动呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这无关你的处境，你还得到了一个升职的机会。<br />科算中心会成立一个专门的部门，你和乌尔里希应该都接到了负责人的邀请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div><b>因为这**的该死的不公平！</b></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>他们从来没有和你共事过一天，甚至不曾听过你的一句发言。他们享用你的成果，却蔑视你的存在——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你会接到处分的唯一原因，就是因为你们——意识唤醒者，不像其他人一样只能牺牲一次！不然他们就该在墓碑前授予你一块勋章了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>喔，那你就应该接受那个职位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——这对你来说是公平的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜的所有话都卡在了嗓子眼里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他张开嘴，想要反驳这天大的羞辱。但愤怒熔断了他的大脑回路，竟让他半天没想出讥讽的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器的条屏闪了闪，继续它无情的理性陈词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>另外，乌尔里希的确得到了勋章。不过和你一样——它也不太高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>此刻它正在委员会大楼前绝食抗议，但鉴于所有人都知道了意识唤醒者的生命有多顽强，它的抗议收效甚微。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露西摇了摇头，似乎在为下属的情绪化行为深表遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在我看来，你和乌尔里希中应该有一个去接受这个职位，你们是最熟悉这项研究的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我不会去的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这既是为了保障研究的进展，更是为了确保它不被滥用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>中肯的劝诫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>该死，你是对的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哑谜陷入了沉默，显然，他的大脑正在原则和责任间做着疯狂的斗争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器没有注意到这些不重要的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不以为意地走到了实验椅前，开始进行最后的电量检查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我并不介意这一处分，霍夫曼研究员。我从不奢求权力，那是你们生物的概念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>从我意识觉醒的那一刻起，我便不理解你们。时至今日，仍然如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷静的陈述，并未掺杂任何情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员有些惊愕地张开了嘴，但机器只是普通地叙说着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们运转的方式并不相同，内驱的燃料也相去甚远。好在，我们有一个共同的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不论是生物还是机器，人类还是神秘学家，多数的有形之物总是希冀着更好的生活。这股原初的热情，正是所谓的“进步”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>因此我装上类人的身躯，佩戴上仿制的面孔，不断调整发声的语调和质感，为了便于与你们交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我的努力不总是有效的，人们经常告诉我，“表面的一致只是彰显了本质的不同。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器遗憾地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——但我依然如此，因为我并不在乎得到认同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们的相交点只是在于进步，从来如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>在平衡伞发明后，科算中心中断八年的研究也将踏上正轨。倘若他们有更合适的舵手，我很乐意在这座轰鸣的引擎里当一个小小的活塞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而且，Z女士为我介绍了一个很好的疗养处。那里有一处弥漫着神秘学气息的湖景庭院，正适合我这样的意识唤醒者去休假散心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它编制灵活，预算独立，唯一需要担忧的是电力供应是否充足。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，还有生锈。也许出发前我应当找X研究员借用他最近研发的“超级钛合金除锈机”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器兴致盎然地陷入了休假生活的畅想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她已经完成了离开的所有准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>出发吧，希曼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……稍等，露西女士，请您最后过目一下这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一叠装订整齐的报告被递交到了露西面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这是您在“暴雨”倒计时期间整理的126种副作用与调和卷轴的拟合情况，关于第34类副作用的数据部分，我有一些疑惑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>露西接过了那个出于自己之手的列表，最后尽职地浏览了一遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，这里的确有一些疏漏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但很抱歉，我必须在今天办完交接手续。我想你之后可以请教乌尔里希先生这个问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将报告还给了研究员，对方却半天没有接下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸张对面，研究员摇了摇头，声音低沉而悲伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>实验还是留下了副作用，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您登记的副作用一共是162种，不是126种。第34类副作用的数据是一个非常明显的抄写失误，我们早就发现并修正了它，用时不过5秒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这是您用生命写下的列表，您却没有第一时间看懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您称呼我为霍夫曼研究员——这仅仅发生在八年前您刚接管科算中心时。之后，为了和我姐姐区别开，同僚们都称呼我为阿德勒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他往前走一步，阴沉地提出了自己的设想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您……丢失了多少数据？甚至损伤到了您的科研能力……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这才是您必须离开的真正原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>您推动了所有人的进步，代价却是您自己的退步——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器没有回答，她罕见地沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>助理希曼上前一步，取走了哑谜迟迟没有接下的那份报告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>出发的时间到了，露西女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯。再见，阿德勒研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>谢谢你纠正我的数据错误。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迈着钢铁的脚步离开了，不再回顾遗留的种种。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——好吧，好吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员扒住门框，罔顾其他人异样的眼光，朝那道背影大喊道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我会去接受那个职务！我会去做你希望我做的事！我会去和那些我厌烦的委员们打交道——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但不是为了楼宇顶层的那些俯瞰我们的大人物们——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/HeadIconSmall-512911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——而是为了那些在外面仰慕这座大厦的人！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器的脚步没有为此停滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在此的职务已经结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，她听到了另一声呼喊。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>——露西女士！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_luxihuitou1\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_luxihuitou1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圆形的走廊上站满了人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员们、文员们、实验室负责人们、警卫们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>科算中心的每个岗位的职员都站到了走廊上，从第一层到最高层。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，有人发出了第一声高呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>向露西女士——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">破译组长：</div><div>致敬！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_luxihuitou2\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_luxihuitou2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/16/Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_luxihuitou2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸片纷纷扬扬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们发出不同语言的告别声，整齐划一将怀里的文件一扔而下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是在过去二十四小时内产生的无数演算纸、设计图、审批文件、行政文书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们因“暴雨”研究而诞生，也在这之后完成了自己的使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——一如这台机器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>为什么人们朝我投掷这些文件，希曼？他们是在表示驱逐吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理希曼：</div><div>……不，我想他们是在表达尊敬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>噢，是这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机器今日并未装配业务交流时所需的表情系统，因此她只是转过身去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阳光照在她金属的棱角上，折射出一片晃眼的金光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>走吧，希曼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我想念拉普拉斯的充电桩了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-308601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>——Z女士引荐的地方，应该也会有230伏特的充电口吧？</div></div></div></div></div><!-- Using template from Html:Custom_bg --><style>/* CSS Minified */.skin-huiji-dragonhide,#rain-background{background-image:url(https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6b/Bg_denglubeijing_b01.jpg)}#rain-background{filter:}</style><!-- Code above is based on Html:Custom_bg -->\n</div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "7TH-30"}}